llo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-25T13:21:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-25T13:21:04Z","body":"I got 3 issues:\r\n\r\nDoesn't work while playing:\r\n![Screenshot from 2025-06-25 10-16-04](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1647f7ea-0b86-4f8b-a56e-051a09a2a876)\r\n\r\nI got this weird looking issue:\r\n![Screenshot from 2025-06-25 10-16-14](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/105e998f-ed53-4133-ae65-674d3c55e60b)\r\n\r\nDoesn't work with reflection probes:\r\n![Screenshot from 2025-06-25 10-16-25](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c649bc8e-6509-4274-a80a-e19540598a08)\r\n\r\nMRP:\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1DppqQ9wFVLnbJdl0JjKpa8Y-g67jZE3L/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3004754089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3005891040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107958#issuecomment-3005891040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107958","id":3005891040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zKkHg","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-25T19:23:13Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T00:26:32Z","body":"@jcostello In this pr I was trying to make the WorldEnvironment sky reflections match the sky reflections when using a ReflectionProbe. ReflectionProbes already use regular fog but not volumetric fog from what I can tell. Issue 1 is because the reflections don't update when you change volumetric fog settings. Issue 2 is because I accidentally enabled volumetric fog in the reflections without any other changes which I wasn't intending on adding with this pr. For issue 3 I don't think I changed the behaviour of ReflectionProbes with this pr, their update mode is set to \"once\" in the mrp and so they don't change when you modify the fog.\r\n\r\n~~At this point I might try to make the volumetric fog work though.~~\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nNow that I think of it volumetric fog in the reflections would definitely be out of the scope of this pr and is much more complicated. It samples a 3d froxel buffer which I think is per-camera and so the sky gets this colour by getting the values at the far end of the buffer whereas regular fog just colours the sky based on colour, energy, etc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3005891040/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4928002230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107958#issuecomm